# Figure 46 (Section 6): the beam at the entrance pupil (element 1, the Obscuring) of CassWithExitPupil.in on a
# 64-point grid with the default UNIFORM source beam and with a GAUSSIAN beam (waist radius 1.0 in x and y, half
# the 4 m aperture) -- at a pupil the intensity IS the beam profile.  The 3.2
# figure used a 25-element beam-expander deck that is not in the tree.  Pages: 0 uniform, 1 gaussian (+ a repeat).
# fig_engine_46.png = [0 | 1].
# COPY: $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/CassWithExitPupil.in fig46
# DEADLINE: 180
cd $TMP/fig46
old CassWithExitPupil.in
mod ngridpts=64
q
pgd
/png
int 1
beam
gau
1.0
1.0
int 1
int 1
! mkdir -p $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/build/figs/fig46; cp $TMP/fig46/giza_*.png $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/build/figs/fig46/
